SystemLabel siesta
SystemName siesta

%include si_cubic.fdf

PAO.BasisType       split
PAO.BasisSize       DZP
PAO.EnergyShift     0.01 Ry

kgrid.MonkhorstPack   [8  8  8]
Mesh.CutOff           250  Ry

MaxSCFIterations      100
DM.Tolerance          1.0d-4
XC.functional         GGA
XC.authors            PBE

## Real relaxation settings -- deliberately ACTIVE (not single-point), to
## verify stb-elasticInputs' own single-point override actually wins over
## these via SIESTA's first-occurrence-wins fdf precedence (config_extra.fdf
## is prepended at the very top of the generated calc.fdf, before these
## lines, so its MD.Steps=0/MD.VariableCell=false take effect instead).
MD.TypeOfRun            CG
MD.VariableCell         true
MD.MaxForceTol          0.01 eV/Ang
MD.Steps                100
